 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nMüller Industrietechnik GmbH                                  MASTER SERVICES\nHauptstraße 42, 20095 Hamburg, Germany                                  AGREEMENT\nUst-IdNr: DE261772669\nReg No: DE-934973\n\nVON                                                           RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nMüller Industrietechnik GmbH                                  Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG\nHauptstraße 42                                                Industrieweg 7\n20095 Hamburg                                                 20095 Hamburg\nGermany                                                       Germany\nVAT: DE261772669\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 19.02.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Müller\nIndustrietechnik GmbH, with its registered office at Hauptstraße 42, Hamburg (\"Party A\"), and Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG,\nwith its registered office at Industrieweg 7, Hamburg (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Müller Industrietechnik GmbH / Jürgen Hoffmann\nParty B      Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG / Anna Weber\nDate         19.02.2026\n\n## Barcodes:\n\nBarcode: 3218581886778\n\n---",
